OL,3,CDisgraced newsreader allowed to enter
OL,4,CEisteddfod poetry competition
OL,6,FDisgraced newsreader Huw Edwards was
OL,7,Fallowed to enter a poetry competition
OL,8,Fat Wales' largest arts festival under
OL,9,Fa pseudonym.
OL,11,FThe former BBC news anchor wrote the
OL,12,Fpoem using the name "Y Gelyn" for the
OL,13,FNational Eisteddfod, translated in
OL,14,FEnglish as "The Enemy".
