OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786114088
OL,3,CDisgraced newsreader allowed to enter
OL,4,CEisteddfod poetry competition
OL,6,FIn 2024, Edwards was given a six-month
OL,7,Fsentence and suspended for two years
OL,8,Fafter admitting he accessed 41 images
OL,9,Fof children, including seven in the
OL,10,Fmost serious category. He has also
OL,11,Fbeen placed on the sex offenders'
OL,12,Fregister for seven years.
OL,14,FOn Sunday (2 August), Edwards wrote in
OL,15,Fhis Substack blog that he had
OL,16,F"attempted to write a poem" for the
OL,17,Ffirst time as a tribute to his father,
OL,18,Fhaving "drawn inspiration" from the
OL,19,FNational Eisteddfod.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
