PN,43904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786114088
OL,3,CDisgraced newsreader allowed to enter
OL,4,CEisteddfod poetry competition
OL,6,F"This is a long-established and
OL,7,Ffundamental principle of the
OL,8,FEisteddfod competitions, ensuring that
OL,9,Fentries are judged anonymously and
OL,10,Fthat no one, including adjudicators,
OL,11,Fknows the identity of competitors
OL,12,Fbefore judging and until their name is
OL,13,Fannounced at the ceremony.
OL,15,F"As we do after every Eisteddfod, we
OL,16,Fwill review this year's competitions
OL,17,Fand processes to ensure they remain
OL,18,Fappropriate."
